---
// Витрина работ: одна работа на всю ширину и три под ней, подписи всегда видны
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { workCaption, type WorkView } from '../lib/works';

interface Props { wide: WorkView | null; trio: WorkView[]; id: string; class?: string }
const { wide, trio, id, class: cls = '' } = Astro.props;
---
<section class={`section ${cls}`} aria-labelledby={id}>
  <div class="wrap head lg:!flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between">
    <slot name="head" />
  </div>
  {wide && (
    <figure class="m-0 flex flex-col">
      <div class="work-feature__photo relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden sm:aspect-[21/9]">
        <Image src={wide.image} alt={wide.alt} widths={[640, 960, 1280]} sizes="100vw" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" style={`object-position:${wide.focus}`} />
        <span class="work-feature__index">01 / {String(trio.length + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
      </div>
      <figcaption class="work-feature__caption">
        <span>РАБОТА УЧЕНИКА</span>
        <span>{workCaption(wide)}</span>
        <a href="/gallery" aria-label="Смотреть работы учеников">↗</a>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  )}
  <div class="wrap mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-[var(--gap-grid)] gap-y-[18px] sm:mt-14 sm:grid-cols-3">
    {trio.map((w, i) => (
      <figure class="zoom m-0 flex flex-col gap-2.5">
        <div class="media-frame media-frame--work-card relative">
          <Image src={w.image} alt={w.alt} widths={[400, 640, 800]} sizes="(min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" style={`object-position:${w.focus}`} />
          <span class="work-grid__index">0{i + 2}</span>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="t-small text-muted">{workCaption(w)}</figcaption>
      </figure>
    ))}
  </div>
  {Astro.slots.has('foot') && <div class="wrap mt-10"><slot name="foot" /></div>}
</section>

<style>
  /* Подпись широкой работы: на всю ширину страницы, с полями сайта (на главной поля задаёт секция) */
  .work-feature__caption { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 6px 12px; min-height: 51px; padding: 12px var(--site-gutter); color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--type-small); }
  .work-feature__caption > span:first-child { width: 100%; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--type-label); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .work-feature__caption > span:nth-child(2) { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .work-feature__caption a { display: grid; width: var(--tap); height: var(--tap); margin-left: auto; place-items: center; color: var(--color-ink); font-size: var(--type-lead); }
  .work-feature__index { position: absolute; z-index: 1; right: 16px; bottom: 16px; padding: 6px 8px; color: var(--color-ink); background: rgb(17 19 19 / .74); font: var(--type-meta) var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .work-grid__index { position: absolute; z-index: 1; right: 10px; bottom: 10px; color: var(--color-ink); font: var(--type-meta) var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .1em; text-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgb(0 0 0 / .6); }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .work-feature__caption > span:first-child { width: auto; } }
</style>
